OL,5,G2200 The Frontier: Under Siege
OL,6,     FAs the United States advanced
OL,7,     Fwest, what appeared to be empty
OL,8,     Fterrain was in fact a richly
OL,9,     Finhabited landscape of indigenous
OL,10,     Fpeoples who would not surrender
OL,11,     Ftheir lands without a fight. (Ep2)
OL,12,G2300 The Frontier: Invasion
OL,13,     FMexican-owned Texas offers land
OL,14,     Fand freedom for those settlers
OL,15,     Fsearching for a fresh start, but
OL,16,     Fthe influx would be the catalyst
OL,17,     Ffor the brutal Mexican-American
OL,18,     Fwar. (Ep3)
